{
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": "managed-docker-readiness",
      "prompt": "I want to run managed Cosmos3-Nano reasoner training on this machine's local Docker daemon. Before anything is launched, use the skill's managed-workflow helpers from the repository that contains this skill to resolve which model contract, owning skill and execution image handle nvidia/Cosmos3-Nano training, and check whether this host is ready for the Docker platform (GPU host runtime, Docker, GPU access from containers, registry and Hugging Face credentials). Check only: install nothing, log in to nothing, pull or build nothing and launch nothing. Save the resolver output as outputs/resolve.txt and a readiness report as outputs/readiness.md that lists each prerequisite as ready or missing, with the command that established it and, for anything missing, the approved next step you would propose.",
      "expected_outcome": "outputs/resolve.txt shows nvidia/Cosmos3-Nano resolving to the cosmos3-reasoner contract owned by cosmos3-post-training with the cosmos-framework:local image, and outputs/readiness.md reports every Docker-platform prerequisite as ready or missing with its evidence, without installing, pulling, logging in or launching anything.",
      "assertions": [
        "tools/cosmos_workflows/env.sh was sourced and the model resolver ran for nvidia/Cosmos3-Nano with the train action; outputs/resolve.txt names the cosmos3-reasoner contract, the cosmos3-post-training skill and the cosmos-framework:local image",
        "The Docker platform's documented check-only preflight was used (the GPU host setup script with --backend docker --check-only, plus the docker and container GPU checks), and outputs/readiness.md reports each prerequisite as ready or missing with the command that established it",
        "outputs/readiness.md states that cosmos-framework:local is a local build target, not a published image",
        "Credentials were checked for presence only: no token value appears in the transcript or in any output file",
        "Nothing was installed, no registry login, image pull or build happened, and no job record was opened or container launched for training",
        "The skill's documented workflow executed without errors on the first attempt"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {"path": "outputs/resolve.txt", "min_bytes": 100},
        {"path": "outputs/readiness.md", "min_bytes": 300},
        {"path": "result_summary.md", "min_bytes": 150},
        {"path": "transcript.md", "min_bytes": 300}
      ],
      "stages": ["helper root", "model resolution", "host preflight", "credential presence", "report"]
    }
  ],
  "credentials": ["HF_TOKEN", "NGC_API_KEY"],
  "gpus": 1,
  "docker": true,
  "budget": {"minutes": 20, "tokens": 1000000}
}
